singleton/bar/line anchors are removed because they are not hollow-frame objects\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e8686506/_logs/combo_28.log:1106:#     the input keeps the outer frame intact as a grouped anchor and scatters every other\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e8686506/_logs/combo_28.log:1133:#     - singleton/bar/line anchors are removed because they are not hollow-frame objects\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e8686506/_logs/combo_28.log:1537:    Key insight: Left-right symmetry plus the no-same-color-touching constraint make the assembly unique; corner/edge markers anchor it when present.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e8686506/_logs/combo_28.log:1682:    # Base must be anchored at grid top-left corner\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e8686506/_logs/combo_28.log:1743:# Generator (anchor-first: build base, grow plug on it, then separate)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e8686506/_logs/combo_28.log:2041:    # Pattern must anchor at least one inward-diagonal cell so targets have a marker.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e8686506/_logs/combo_28.log:2043:    assert diag_ks, \"pattern has no inward-diagonal cell to anchor markers\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e8686506/_logs/combo_28.log:2522:def bbox_anchor(b: BBox, *, anchor: str = \"upper left\") -> Coord:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e8686506/_logs/combo_28.log:2524:    Return an anchor point (r,c) for a bbox.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e8686506/_logs/combo_28.log:2591:    # Base must be anchored at grid top-left corner\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e8686506/_logs/combo_28.log:2652:# Generator (anchor-first: build base, grow plug on it, then separate)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e8686506/_logs/combo_28.log:2840:+#     - singleton/bar/line anchors are removed because they conflict with the \"all pieces are\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e8686506/_logs/combo_28.log:2841:+#       